{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Act as an expert Shopify theme developer. Generate a responsive, pixel-perfect custom section titled "Featured & Referenced". The layout must 100% replicate the spacing, mixed card styles, alignment, and sizing of the provided reference design while automatically inheriting the active Shopify theme's global typography and maximum page width constraints.
    
    ---
    
    ### 1. SECTION ARCHITECTURE & GRID SETTINGS
    
    #### GLOBAL WRAPPER
    - Constrain the entire section to the theme's core standard page width max-width layout (e.g., `var(--page-width)` or `1200px`) and ensure it centers automatically on large viewports.
    - Apply generous top and bottom section padding to preserve an editorial, spacious look.
    
    #### INTRODUCTORY HEADER BLOCK
    - Create a full-width text block layout at the top:
      - Section Title: Bold, large typography styled in a deep navy/slate tone (e.g., "Featured & Referenced").
      - Section Subtitle: Placed directly below the title. Medium-grey, highly legible text with comfortable line-height (e.g., "Flow's approach to retail analytics..."). Add an intentional margin below this subtitle to separate it cleanly from the grid cards.
    
    #### DESKTOP & MOBILE GRID LAYOUT
    - Desktop: Exactly 3 equal-width columns arranged in a single row. Use a uniform grid gap between 24px and 32px.
    - Mobile: Dynamically collapse the layout into a single vertical column (1 column wide, 3 rows down).
    - All 3 cards must share identical, matching vertical heights (`display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; height: 100%;`) within a desktop row.
    
    ---
    
    ### 2. CARD-SPECIFIC TYPE & ANATOMY
    
    The 3-column layout must accommodate two distinct block styles, all fully customizable via the theme editor:
    
    #### CARD STYLE A: PRESS/LOGO CARDS (Columns 1 and 2)
    - Container Style: Pure white background, rounded corners (border-radius: 16px), and a thin, crisp, neutral-light border (1px solid `#e2e8f0` or theme equivalent). Uniform internal padding on all sides.
    - Top Element (Dynamic Logo Container): A dedicated setting to upload a custom publication or partner brand image logo. Ensure the image scales proportionally within a fixed-height layout zone to prevent distortions.
    - Middle Element (Quote/Description): A multi-line paragraph block. Style with a medium-grey body text color and comfortable line-height (1.5) for quotes or feature summaries.
    - Base Element (Meta Stamp): Positioned cleanly at the very bottom left of the card container using small, muted grey, uppercase typography indicating context and dates (e.g., "Industry Research, 2024", "Press Coverage, 2023").
    
    #### CARD STYLE B: HIGHLIGHT RESULTS CARD (Column 3)
    - Container Style: Solid, high-contrast block using a rich dark navy/deep blue background (`#003b64` or the theme's primary deep brand color). Rounded corners (border-radius: 16px) with matching internal padding. No borders.
    - Top Element (Caps Header): Small, bold, wide-tracked (letter-spacing) uppercase text in a light, desaturated blue or grey tone reading "CUSTOMER RESULTS".
    - Middle Element (Hero Statistic Value): Giant, high-impact, bold metric text rendered in pure white typography (e.g., "108.9%").
    - Description Element: Positioned directly beneath the metric value. Light-weight, clean body text in a soft off-white/light-grey tone for the metric context.
    - Base Element (Call to Action Link): Positioned at the very bottom left. A text-link styled in an accent tone (e.g., moss green `#a4b953` or bright gold/white) reading "View Case Studies" followed by an inline right chevron character (›).
    
    ---
    
    ### 3. BACKEND CONFIGURATION & CUSTOMIZATION SETTINGS
    
    Ensure every piece of text, metric value, link target, and media element can be updated in the customizer. The section block array schema must accept two custom block types:
    1. Block Type: "press_card" (Max instances: 2)
       - Image Settings: `image_picker` for the brand logo upload.
       - Textarea Settings: Rich text or text block for the description/quote body.
       - Text Settings: Single-line field for the bottom metadata stamp.
    2. Block Type: "results_card" (Max instances: 1)
       - Text Settings: Single-line field for upper header, hero metric, and paragraph description.
       - URL & Text Settings: Fields to define the CTA link path and label text.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-featured-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 80px 0;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.section_background }};
  }

  .ai-featured-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: var(--page-width, 1600px);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 var(--section-horizontal-spacing, 40px);
  }

  .ai-featured-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin-bottom: 56px;
  }

  .ai-featured-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.title_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.title_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.title_font.weight }};
    font-style: {{ block.settings.title_font.style }};
    font-size: 48px;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: {{ block.settings.title_color }};
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
  }

  .ai-featured-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.subtitle_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.subtitle_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.subtitle_font.weight }};
    font-style: {{ block.settings.subtitle_font.style }};
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: {{ block.settings.subtitle_color }};
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .ai-featured-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 28px;
  }

  .ai-press-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 32px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.press_card_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.press_card_border }};
  }

  .ai-press-logo-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    height: 48px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .ai-press-logo-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
    max-height: 100%;
    width: auto;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  .ai-press-logo-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    height: 100%;
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    border-radius: 8px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 12px;
  }

  .ai-press-logo-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    max-width: 120px;
    max-height: 48px;
  }

  .ai-press-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.body_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.body_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.body_font.weight }};
    font-style: {{ block.settings.body_font.style }};
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: {{ block.settings.press_text_color }};
    margin: 0 0 24px 0;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .ai-press-meta-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.body_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.body_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.body_font.weight }};
    font-style: {{ block.settings.body_font.style }};
    font-size: 12px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    color: {{ block.settings.press_meta_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-results-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 32px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.results_card_background }};
  }

  .ai-results-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.body_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.body_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 12px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1.2px;
    color: {{ block.settings.results_header_color }};
    margin: 0 0 24px 0;
  }

  .ai-results-metric-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.title_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.title_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 64px;
    line-height: 1;
    color: {{ block.settings.results_metric_color }};
    margin: 0 0 12px 0;
  }

  .ai-results-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.body_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.body_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.body_font.weight }};
    font-style: {{ block.settings.body_font.style }};
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: {{ block.settings.results_description_color }};
    margin: 0 0 24px 0;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .ai-results-cta-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.body_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.body_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: {{ block.settings.results_cta_color }};
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
  }

  .ai-results-cta-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-featured-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 60px 0;
    }

    .ai-featured-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 36px;
    }

    .ai-featured-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .ai-featured-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .ai-results-metric-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 48px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-featured-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 40px 0;
    }

    .ai-featured-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .ai-featured-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 28px;
    }

    .ai-press-card-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .ai-results-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 24px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-featured-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-featured-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-featured-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.section_title != blank %}
        <h2 class="ai-featured-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.section_title }}</h2>
      {% endif %}
      {% if block.settings.section_subtitle != blank %}
        <div class="ai-featured-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.section_subtitle }}</div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    <div class="ai-featured-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-press-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-press-logo-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.press_1_logo != blank %}
            <img
              src="{{ block.settings.press_1_logo | image_url: width: 300 }}"
              alt="{{ block.settings.press_1_logo.alt | escape }}"
              loading="lazy"
              width="{{ block.settings.press_1_logo.width }}"
              height="{{ block.settings.press_1_logo.height }}"
            >
          {% else %}
            <div class="ai-press-logo-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
        <div class="ai-press-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.press_1_description }}
        </div>
        {% if block.settings.press_1_metadata != blank %}
          <div class="ai-press-meta-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.press_1_metadata }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      <div class="ai-press-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-press-logo-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.press_2_logo != blank %}
            <img
              src="{{ block.settings.press_2_logo | image_url: width: 300 }}"
              alt="{{ block.settings.press_2_logo.alt | escape }}"
              loading="lazy"
              width="{{ block.settings.press_2_logo.width }}"
              height="{{ block.settings.press_2_logo.height }}"
            >
          {% else %}
            <div class="ai-press-logo-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
        <div class="ai-press-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.press_2_description }}
        </div>
        {% if block.settings.press_2_metadata != blank %}
          <div class="ai-press-meta-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.press_2_metadata }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      <div class="ai-results-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.results_header != blank %}
          <div class="ai-results-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.results_header }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.results_metric != blank %}
          <div class="ai-results-metric-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.results_metric }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.results_description != blank %}
          <div class="ai-results-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.results_description }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.results_cta_text != blank and block.settings.results_cta_url != blank %}
          <a href="{{ block.settings.results_cta_url }}" class="ai-results-cta-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.results_cta_text }} ›
          </a>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Featured & Referenced",
  "tag": null,
  "class": "ai-featured-referenced-section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Section header"
    },
    {
      "type": "inline_richtext",
      "id": "section_title",
      "label": "Title",
      "default": "Featured & Referenced"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "section_subtitle",
      "label": "Subtitle",
      "default": "Flow's approach to retail analytics has been recognized by industry leaders and trusted by innovative brands worldwide."
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Press card 1"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "press_1_logo",
      "label": "Publication logo"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "press_1_description",
      "label": "Quote or description",
      "default": "Flow Solutions delivers cutting-edge retail analytics that transform how businesses understand their customers and optimize operations."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "press_1_metadata",
      "label": "Metadata",
      "default": "Industry Research, 2024"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Press card 2"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "press_2_logo",
      "label": "Publication logo"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "press_2_description",
      "label": "Quote or description",
      "default": "Innovative technology that provides actionable insights for modern retailers seeking to enhance customer experience and drive growth."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "press_2_metadata",
      "label": "Metadata",
      "default": "Press Coverage, 2023"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Results card"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "results_header",
      "label": "Header",
      "default": "CUSTOMER RESULTS"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "results_metric",
      "label": "Metric value",
      "default": "108.9%"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "results_description",
      "label": "Description",
      "default": "Average increase in conversion rates for retail clients using Flow's analytics platform."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "results_cta_text",
      "label": "CTA text",
      "default": "View Case Studies"
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "results_cta_url",
      "label": "CTA link"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Colors"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "section_background",
      "label": "Section background",
      "default": "#f9fafb"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "title_color",
      "label": "Title",
      "default": "#11243e"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "subtitle_color",
      "label": "Subtitle",
      "default": "#677279"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Press card style"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "press_card_background",
      "label": "Background",
      "default": "#ffffff"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "press_card_border",
      "label": "Border",
      "default": "#e2e8f0"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "press_text_color",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "#677279"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "press_meta_color",
      "label": "Metadata",
      "default": "#94a3b8"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Results card style"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "results_card_background",
      "label": "Background",
      "default": "#003b64"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "results_header_color",
      "label": "Header",
      "default": "#94a3b8"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "results_metric_color",
      "label": "Metric",
      "default": "#ffffff"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "results_description_color",
      "label": "Description",
      "default": "#e2e8f0"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "results_cta_color",
      "label": "CTA link",
      "default": "#a4b953"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Typography"
    },
    {
      "type": "font_picker",
      "id": "title_font",
      "label": "Title font",
      "default": "inter_n5"
    },
    {
      "type": "font_picker",
      "id": "subtitle_font",
      "label": "Subtitle font",
      "default": "inter_n4"
    },
    {
      "type": "font_picker",
      "id": "body_font",
      "label": "Body font",
      "default": "inter_n4"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "desktop_width_percent",
      "label": "Desktop width",
      "min": 50,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 5,
      "unit": "%",
      "default": 100
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Featured & Referenced"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
